<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  strikers-quest: the Quest launcher panel (LobbyActivity) and what it shows from GameFile,
  StarLogo, TourneyClient and BracketView. Kept apart from strings.xml, which is the phone
  launcher's: a language with no translation here falls back to this English, which is why
  MissingTranslation is ignored for this file.

  Left in English on purpose, in every language: "Grudge Match" (the game's own mode, as the
  English disc names it), "Classic" / "Plus" (the Version names), RetroAchievements, and
  "GOAL SCORED BY" (drawn by the game itself).
-->
